<LegalPage title="About Us" description="What DealsSite is, how it finds offers and how it earns money.">
  <p>DealsSite is a discount and promo code directory with a blog. We list current offers from brands around the world and show the ones that apply to the country you are visiting from.</p>

  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <p>We collect discounts, free trials, store sales and promo codes, organise them by country, category, brand and city, and link to the brand's official page so you can confirm the final price before you buy.</p>

  <h2>How offers are listed</h2>
  <p>Each listing shows the brand, the type of offer, the date it was last checked and, where the brand states one, an end date. Offers can change or end without notice, so we always recommend confirming terms on the official site.</p>

  <h2>How we earn</h2>
  <p>Some outbound links are affiliate links. If you buy through one, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. We also show advertising. Read the <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">Affiliate Disclosure</a> for details.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions, corrections or brand requests can be sent through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
